@page "/components/toggle-group"

<PageTitle>Toggle Group — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Toggle Group</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A row of toggles. <code>Multiple</code> decides whether the items are checkboxes or radios,
    which is the DOM's own version of Radix's <code>type="single" | "multiple"</code> — and it
    means the group posts either one value or a list, with no JavaScript involved.
</p>

