<h2 class="doc-h2">Spacing</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Zero — the default, and shadcn's — joins the items into one segmented control with shared
    borders. It is both an attribute and the <code>--gap</code> custom property, because the
    recipe reads one and the gap utility reads the other.
</p>
